<title>RUSSIA: Rouble rises to 3,568.99 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble rises to 3,568.99 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,568.99 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,598.00 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 23		 Sept 20</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,568.99		3,598.00</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.08		    2.06</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
